# Obsidian
# website: https://obsidian.md
# docs: https://obsidian.md/help/
# description: Obsidian markdown knowledge base vault ignore rules for workspace layouts, cache, trash, and plugin binaries.

# Application workspace and UI state (prevents device merge conflicts)
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/graph.json

# Internal vault cache and indexing
.obsidian/cache/

# Local trash directory (deleted notes)
.trash/

# Community plugins (ignore downloaded plugin code, retain configs)
.obsidian/plugins/*/**
!.obsidian/plugins/*/data.json